{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../mfa_client/", "title": "Mfa Client"}, "next": {"link": "../passwordless_client/", "title": "Passwordless Client"}, "title": "My Account Client", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_server.my_account_client\">\n<span id=\"my-account-client\"></span><h1>My Account Client<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_server.my_account_client\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient\" title=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MyAccountClient</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Client for interacting with the Auth0 MyAccount API.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_server.my_account_client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MyAccountClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">domain</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">headers</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ssl_context</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ssl.SSLContext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Client for interacting with the Auth0 MyAccount API.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.complete_connect_account\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">complete_connect_account</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountRequest</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.CompleteConnectAccountResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.complete_connect_account\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Complete the connected account flow after user authorization.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token for authentication</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>request</strong> \u2013 Request containing the auth session, connect code, and redirect URI</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Response containing the connected account details including ID, connection, and scopes</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.connect_account\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">connect_account</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ConnectAccountRequest</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ConnectAccountResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.connect_account\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initiate the connected account flow.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token for authentication</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>request</strong> \u2013 Request containing connection details and configuration</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Response containing the connect URI and authentication session details</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.delete_authentication_method\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete_authentication_method</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">authentication_method_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.delete_authentication_method\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete an authentication method by ID.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token (scope: delete:me:authentication-methods).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>authentication_method_id</strong> \u2013 ID of the authentication method to delete.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 key for DPoP-bound token presentation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token or authentication_method_id is not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.delete_connected_account\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">delete_connected_account</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">connected_account_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.delete_connected_account\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Delete a connected account for the authenticated user.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token for authentication</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>connected_account_id</strong> \u2013 ID of the connected account to delete</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>None</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token or connected_account_id is not provided</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.enroll_authentication_method\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">enroll_authentication_method</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.EnrollAuthenticationMethodRequest</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.EnrollmentChallengeResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.enroll_authentication_method\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Step 1 of 2: Start enrollment (POST /me/v1/authentication-methods).</p>\n<p>For passkey enrollment, pass the returned authn_params_public_key to\nnavigator.credentials.create(), then call verify_authentication_method()\nwith the auth_session and credential result.</p>\n<p>Requires scope: create:me:authentication-methods</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.get_authentication_method\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_authentication_method</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">authentication_method_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AuthenticationMethod</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.get_authentication_method\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Retrieve a single authentication method by ID.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token (scope: read:me:authentication-methods).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>authentication_method_id</strong> \u2013 ID of the authentication method to retrieve.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 key for DPoP-bound token presentation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>AuthenticationMethod for the requested ID.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token or authentication_method_id is not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.get_factors\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">get_factors</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.GetFactorsResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.get_factors\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Retrieve the list of factors available for enrollment.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token (scope: read:me:factors).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 key for DPoP-bound token presentation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>GetFactorsResponse containing the available factors.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token is not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_authentication_methods\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_authentication_methods</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">type_filter</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ListAuthenticationMethodsResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_authentication_methods\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List the user\u2019s enrolled authentication methods.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token (scope: read:me:authentication-methods).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>type_filter</strong> \u2013 Optional authentication-method type to filter results by.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 key for DPoP-bound token presentation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>ListAuthenticationMethodsResponse containing the enrolled methods.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token is not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_connected_account_connections\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_connected_account_connections</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">from_param</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">take</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ListConnectedAccountConnectionsResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_connected_account_connections\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List available connections that support connected accounts.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token for authentication</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>from_param</strong> \u2013 Optional pagination cursor for fetching next page of results</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>take</strong> \u2013 Optional number of results to return (must be a positive integer)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Response containing the list of available connections and pagination details</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token is not provided</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.InvalidArgumentError\" title=\"error.InvalidArgumentError\"><strong>InvalidArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If take parameter is not a positive integer</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_connected_accounts\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_connected_accounts</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">connection</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">from_param</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">take</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ListConnectedAccountsResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.list_connected_accounts\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>List connected accounts for the authenticated user.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token for authentication</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>connection</strong> \u2013 Optional filter to list accounts for a specific connection</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>from_param</strong> \u2013 Optional pagination cursor for fetching next page of results</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>take</strong> \u2013 Optional number of results to return (must be a positive integer)</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>Response containing the list of connected accounts and pagination details</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token is not provided</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.InvalidArgumentError\" title=\"error.InvalidArgumentError\"><strong>InvalidArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If take parameter is not a positive integer</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.update_authentication_method\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">update_authentication_method</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">authentication_method_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.UpdateAuthenticationMethodRequest</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AuthenticationMethod</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.update_authentication_method\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Update an authentication method by ID.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>access_token</strong> \u2013 User\u2019s access token (scope: update:me:authentication-methods).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>authentication_method_id</strong> \u2013 ID of the authentication method to update.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>request</strong> \u2013 Fields to update on the authentication method.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 key for DPoP-bound token presentation.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>AuthenticationMethod reflecting the updated state.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\" title=\"error.MissingRequiredArgumentError\"><strong>MissingRequiredArgumentError</strong></a> \u2013 If access_token, authentication_method_id, or request is not provided.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MyAccountApiError\" title=\"error.MyAccountApiError\"><strong>MyAccountApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the API returns an error response.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ApiError\" title=\"error.ApiError\"><strong>ApiError</strong></a> \u2013 If the request fails due to network or other issues.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.verify_authentication_method\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">verify_authentication_method</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">authentication_method_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">request</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.VerifyAuthenticationMethodRequest</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AuthenticationMethod</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.verify_authentication_method\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Step 2 of 2: Verify enrollment (POST /me/v1/authentication-methods/{id}/verify).</p>\n<p>Requires scope: create:me:authentication-methods</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py property\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.audience\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">property</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">audience</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.audience\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the MyAccount API audience URL.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>The audience URL for the MyAccount API</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/passwordless_client/index", "Passwordless Client", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_server/mfa_client/index", "Mfa Client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_server/my_account_client/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">My Account Client</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MyAccountClient</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.my_account_client.MyAccountClient.complete_connect_account\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MyAccountClient.complete_connect_account()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"refer